        "brief": "A Level Principal at NAMI College with over 21 years of expertise in business and accounting education. Leads academic coordination, Cambridge curriculum implementation, and student development.",
        "bio": "Mr. Philip Badikar Hilario is an experienced educator and academic administrator with over 21 years of expertise in business and accounting education. As A Level Principal at NAMI College, he leads academic coordination, curriculum implementation, and student development, ensuring high academic standards and promoting a culture of excellence.\n\nMr. Hilario has taught Business and Accounting at A Level across several reputed institutions in Nepal, consistently demonstrating strong leadership, subject expertise, and a passion for student-centred learning. His dedication to academic excellence and institutional growth is reflected in his ability to build effective teaching teams, introduce best practices in pedagogy, and mentor students toward both academic and professional success.\n\nHe holds international qualifications, including an LCCI Level 3 certification in Advanced Business Calculations, and is currently pursuing the ACCA (UK), a globally recognized credential in accounting and finance. These qualifications enhance his analytical and leadership capabilities, enabling evidence-based decision-making and aligning academic delivery with global best practices.",
